    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 18 给大表自动清理加上死元组上限",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 18 新增的 autovacuum_vacuum_max_threshold 给自动清理的触发条件加了一个硬上限。旧公式按比例计算，十亿行的表要积累两亿死元组才触发清理；新参数默认一亿元组，实际阈值取它与旧公式结果中较小的那个，五亿行是分界点。Christophe Pettus 建议在 18 上保持默认值，只对更新极频繁的大表按表设更紧的上限，设成 -1 则关掉上限。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/all-your-gucs-in-a-row-autovacuumvacuummaxthreshold/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-05-09",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/c59dd88c094b4270969d9abc8c47056e.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "autovacuum",
        "参数",
        "PostgreSQL 18"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "AWS 演示从 Aurora 快照迁移到 Aurora DSQL",
      "summary": "Aurora DSQL 无法直接还原 Aurora PostgreSQL 的快照。AWS Database Blog 给出的路径分五步：做快照、导出到 S3 成 Parquet、用 Glue 爬虫编目、跑 PySpark 作业转换，再写入 Aurora DSQL。更值得先看的是限制：DSQL 每个集群只有一个数据库，多库要分次迁移；时间戳列要从字节数组转回；单事务三千行的上限要求调小批量；主键换成 UUID 后外键关系需要重建。",
      "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/database/migrating-data-from-an-amazon-aurora-snapshot-into-amazon-aurora-dsql/",
      "author": "Dan Blaner",
      "source": "AWS Database Blog",
      "source_date": "2026-05-07",
      "image": "https://d2908q01vomqb2.cloudfront.net/887309d048beef83ad3eabf2a79a64a389ab1c9f/2026/04/23/DB4683.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "Aurora DSQL",
        "迁移",
        "AWS Glue"
      ],
      "position": 2
